{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_st02",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_st02",
  "title": "自灰烬之中",
  "storyCode": "FC-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7f6cfc1a17156e7f829d86fddc8f90cefd06f876b921132a22a2e30550f1f8fd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“阿赫茉妮”的间谍身份得以确认，但她安插的情报人员已经全部在掩护下提前撤离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那名感染者的确是另一条德拉克。她的动向已经在我们的掌控之中，只要得到指令，我的部队会继续追捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......另外，恕我冒昧，请问在屏风后听取汇报的人，您是头领，还是......公爵阁下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很敏锐，上一个能指出这一点的孩子，我已经不记得是在几年前遇见的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我只是想享用完这杯红茶。请坐过来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，作为感染者，我站在这里就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你来的时候，看到街角那家小剧院了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，我看到了......剧院没有开张，也没有可疑的人在附近徘徊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是一些自称塔拉人的艺术家建起的剧院，每晚那里都会上演基于塔拉文化创作的剧目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......需要我去调查他们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我很欣赏他们的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "追捕那条德拉克的事，你不用担心，我会交给其他人去做。你带来的情报很有价值，以你的才能，不必把时间消耗在收尾的工作上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想请你，为我去特定地点监视威灵顿公爵的行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是，感谢您的赏识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开斯特公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，之前那个问题，你想好答案了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，信使小姐，你能把信捎多远？多远都行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，你能帮忙写信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就写几句话，我只是想跟家里人说一声我还活着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚刚那位农户说的，你们应该听到了。这里定时会有商队路过，半小时后就会有一支。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们跟着商队走，能藏进载具的话，最好。靠近橡林郡的地区，应该是威灵顿公爵直属的领地，他不会容许针对塔拉人的暴行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "错过这次机会的话，会很危险。搜捕队从附近的移动城市赶到这里，以最快的速度，应该不用一小时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但你们只要能逃出去，之后的生活就不用太担心。那些人想要的是我，跟丢了你们的踪迹之后，他们不会再追的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，等等......所以，风笛说你是什么深池的领袖，不是我听错了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，如果你们之中还有人想要跟着深池战斗，可以和我一起，继续走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但深池的身份没有办法成为你们的保护伞。之后的路，或许也会像现在一样......被很多人监视，继续被人追赶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我回来了，嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我照着你的话跟她说了，说我跟村里逃出来的人一起，在这边落脚了，然后编了个石高原野上找不到的地名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......可那个信使看起来人挺好的，要是她是真的信使，不是来查我们动向的人，那我不是害得她白跑一趟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我大部分时间，都过着东躲西藏的生活。像她那样假扮信使的追踪者，我见过许多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，好吧。以后还要继续这么过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别叹气了，我们抓紧时间分一分手上的物资。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这样受伤了的，就别勉强自己跟着苇草走了。为塔拉人打仗的事，我们帮你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，那我这算不算是，已经为塔拉人打过啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......苇草，过来过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我得跟你说件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本来我是写在遗书上的，唉，但我活下来了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......一开始，用锄头砸倒那个士兵，害得所有人都得逃跑的人，是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那天晚上，我见到当兵的在打人，打图利家的小女儿，就从别人家的墙根抄了一把锄头，摸了过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是不是抖得厉害？......真对不起，唉。过去这么久了，我还老是梦见那个场景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女孩才十四岁，尖声尖气的，哭得让人心慌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想，天那么黑，也不许点灯，就算这一锄头砸破了头，流了血，样子再怎么惨，我也看不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是......我没想到害了那么多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "后来我想陪着他们，给所有人想办法安顿下来，自己再离开，算是偿还我犯的错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是有的人最后也没能走到落脚的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......证件不齐的罪名，是你给自己编的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一开始通缉令上面没有我，我怕他们起疑心，才特地跟费加尔一块去抢药店......结果又把你也牵扯进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要这么说，维恩。我的身份，总有一天会追上我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......塔拉人的悲哀，也总有一天会追上每个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好，好，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，莫兰，你想不想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了，维恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不，没什么。绳子给我吧，我来捆，你这样带着行李走不远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵呵，你是行家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也要跟着苇草继续打仗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。塞尔蒙说，我很有力气，应该可以做不少事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......可你在黑的地方就看不见东西，多不方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，那可是打仗啊，要面对的敌人肯定比我们那天晚上见到的更多，更厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有大炮。打仗不是那种被砍一刀流点血的事，不是戏里面演的那样，英雄被打倒，还能爬起来。人会一下子就死掉，死得很难看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但是我想选这条路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想，抓住我生活里难得的选择机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "商队靠近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，我去和他们交涉，把受伤的人送走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "苇草......我能走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在的我，能离开了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我想，一切都已经准备好了。\n只剩下......我的妹妹，她还在外彷徨，但她终究会做出正确的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“加斯特里尔”号高速战舰甲板"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曾经最庞大的移动城市上抽离的一根骸骨，搭载维多利亚军工技术纯粹的结晶，多少人该以登上这艘高速战舰为荣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "纵使放眼整片泰拉大地，我想也不会有能与此媲美的军事机器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若非如此，它便配不上德拉克麾下传奇将领之名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也有许多人一直窥探着它的动向，试图从中揣摩您的立场......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在长达七年的巡游之后，今天该是它靠岸的日子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们转向后，有多少信使正在回报讯息的路上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了开斯特公爵，各位公爵都在保持关注，但他们掌控下的任何一支军队都已经来不及干预。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "橡林郡已经停止行驶，做好接驳准备。虽然这是本舰七年来首次靠近一座移动城市，但停留过程中，并无过多资源补给和机械维护需求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伯爵表示，届时会亲自前往港口迎接您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些踟蹰不前的阿斯兰附庸，恐怕到这艘舰船径直驶向橡林郡的时刻才会发现，这座城市究竟权属归谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而这里将再次升起怎样的火焰，他们还一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "深池的军队，那些渴望从不公中解脱的塔拉人，已经从维多利亚各处赶来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的谋臣......她做得很不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的城市，是否停在了我期望的地点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。受限于地形与安全因素，这就是城市航道上最靠近废城遗迹的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您怎么看，爱布拉娜殿下？在前来的路上，您造访过那处遗址。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想这样就够了。无论塔拉文化的复兴者将多少想象寄托在盖尔王的王城上，那终究只是一处衰朽的废墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "届时那些浪漫的梦想家只需要透过原野的晨雾，朝它的方向投去一瞥，知道它曾经矗立在山丘上而如今已经被天灾损毁，就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听说，塔拉王朝覆灭、德拉克族裔出逃后，阿斯兰们放任那座石城空置，直到它在天灾中坍塌，几乎被塔拉人遗忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那古旧王朝的残余......原本也十分无趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚的君主分封的盖尔王头衔，不过是仆臣的美称。要是留有王冠，我就要将它熔毁；要是尚有王座，我就要将它一把火烧成灰烬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，那里却连这些都不剩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因此那位年轻的沃里克，从盖尔王的传说开始找回塔拉的历史，不是坏事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您说的是那位“颂古者”沃里克，“北方战线的沃里克”？......啊，您认识他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾向他的宴会派出使者。这艘战舰的巡游正是从那时开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您一向高瞻远瞩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不算多么长久的等待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威灵顿公爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "橡林郡......您想去看看这座城市吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然。我很好奇，在那场大火后，它被重塑成了什么模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟，它曾经是我的家乡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我握着姐姐的长枪，站在走廊上等了一会儿。\n府邸里的每个人都沉默地低着头，刻意忙碌着，一旦看到我就移开视线。\n老师的身体一直不好，晚上冒着风雪从宴会回来后就没有离开过自己的房间。戴莉医生为他准备了甜酒，却没有按时来取走空杯。\n门缝中传出细小的木头爆裂声。雪夜的炉火应该很温暖，此刻火焰平静燃烧的声音却令我牙齿打战。\n我还是推开了门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......既然你已经说服所有人背叛了我......那这杯甜酒，我为什么不喝呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以为，您会想知道自己哪里有过失，才导致您的仆从们求助于我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......这不重要，爱布拉娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "重要的是，你能使他们，一直信你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您也不问，为什么我愿意答应他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳......你知道，我死后，这座城市会发生什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "贵族间的力量会失衡，菲利普伯爵在议会上的发言不会再有人反对，但为了得到斯塔福德公爵的重视，那两位年轻的男爵会在暗中动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "与此同时，刚刚找回姓名的塔拉人会失去他们的领袖与庇护者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们会在严苛的法令与贵族的反复无常之间被翻搅，蹂躏，直到......忍无可忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但即使您活着，那一切流血、暴力与动乱，也迟早会发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我说得对吗，老师？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵呵......到了那时候，你会如何做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会......伸手将他们从灰烬中拉起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老师失去血色的脸上，不知为何浮现了欣慰的笑容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "贪婪的德拉克，野心无穷无尽的德拉克......我半生的搜寻，没有找错......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他摘下眼镜，缓慢而艰难地转头，望向大雪纷飞的窗外。\n十年前的冬夜，他念完传奇小说，手指抚过书脊上烫金的塔拉字母时，也曾露出那样眷恋又期盼的眼神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看到......属于塔拉的新时代......近在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮啊......\n还有......\n你......\n我一动不动地站在门口。玻璃窗上，映出的是我被冰冷的火焰照亮的脸。\n如此惶恐，却与那副怜悯的面孔，一模一样。\n......拉芙希妮，你会是谁的学生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
